6
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.200
And the stop rogue AI Act.

7
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.600
And you listen to all of this and you realize we have a huge problem.

8
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:06.960
And this huge problem is just making my head explode, which is the AI people are making it impossible for anybody to understand what they've done.

9
00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.800
