24
00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:35.800
And just because it decides to do it, not based on step one, step two, step three, if A or B do step five, but just based on statistics, that doesn't mean you eliminate the idea that it should do what you want it to do.

25
00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.960
